@startuml ai-branding-pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title KITE PLATFORM - AI BRANDING PIPELINE v2\n(Agent Workflow: Analyzer -> Planner -> Executor -> QualityReviewer)\nUpdated: 2026-04-26 (GAP-234)

start

:Tenant onboarding (KiteHub)
publishes TenantCreated event
to RabbitMQ ""tenant.created"";

:""TenantProvisioningSaga""
(kiteclass-core / module/provisioning)
creates ""FrontendInstance""
status = INITIALIZING;

:Persist outbox event
""instance.initializing""
(transactional);

#E8EAF6:Analyzer step
""AnalyzerService.analyze(req, tenant)""
- Read uploaded logo (if any) via local Ollama (llava)
- Extract palette + dominant tone
- Detect language (vi/en) + audience hint
Returns ""AnalysisResult"";

#C5CAE9:Planner step
""PlannerService.generatePlan(analysis)""
- Selects ordered ""Step"" list
- Per resource: classify ResourceCategory
  - STATIC (uploaded asset)  -> StaticResourceHandler
  - TEMPLATE (SVG + brand params) -> TemplateResourceHandler
  - FULL_AI (custom hero) -> AIResourceHandler
Returns ""BrandingPlan"";

note right
  Decision logic per
  ai-branding-guidelines.md §1
  template-first; FULL_AI only when
  no matching template + tier allows.
end note

#B3E5FC:Executor loop
""PlanExecutor.execute(plan, ctx)""
status -> GENERATING
For each Step:
- ExtractPaletteStep
- PickTemplateStep
- (AI step only if FULL_AI selected)
- PublishPackageStep
- QualityReviewStep
On Step error: try ""fallback()""
(template fallback);

fork
  :STATIC / TEMPLATE path
  Compose SVG + brand params
  Latency ~1-3s
  Cost ~$0;
fork again
  :FULL_AI path (rare, gated by tier)
  Enqueue AIJobPayload to RabbitMQ
  ""ai.request.{tier}"" queue
  (enterprise:pro:free, weighted 3:2:1)
  via ""AIQueueDispatcher"" (kitehub-branding)
  Worker calls Ollama llama3.1 / llava
  (Gemma 4 9B planned per GAP-006)
  Latency 10s-5min, async;
end fork

#FFF9C4:Quality Reviewer
""InstanceQualityReviewer.review(instanceId)""
runs 5 checks (kiteclass-core / module/quality):
1. ContrastQualityCheck (WCAG >= 4.5:1)
2. CssVarsQualityCheck (no defaults remaining)
3. AssetUrlsQualityCheck (no 404s)
4. VisualRegressionQualityCheck (<= 20% diff)
5. LogoPlacementQualityCheck (size + crop)
Persists ""QualityReport"" (V39);

if (score >= 70?) then (yes)
  #C8E6C9:""ContentModerationService""
  3-stage pipeline:
  keyword filter -> ML scaffold -> human review (queue)
  Status -> APPROVED;

  :""TenantProvisioningSaga""
  transitions FrontendInstance
  status -> DEPLOYED
  Publishes outbox event
  ""instance.deployed""
  Snapshot to ""branding_versions"" (V43);

  :KiteClass FE fetches
  GET /api/v1/branding/{instanceId}/package
  Theme + assets + ETag
  Cached, SSE invalidation;

  stop
else (no, score < 70)
  #FFCDD2:Mark FAILED
  Persist failure reason
  Auto retry (max retryCount)
  or surface to admin;
  stop
endif

legend right
|= Layer |= Component |= Module |
| Provisioning | TenantProvisioningSaga | kiteclass-core/provisioning |
| Workflow | AnalyzerService | kiteclass-core/ai/workflow |
| Workflow | PlannerService | kiteclass-core/ai/workflow |
| Workflow | PlanExecutor + Steps | kiteclass-core/ai/workflow |
| Routing | StaticResourceHandler | kiteclass-core/branding/handler |
| Routing | TemplateResourceHandler | kiteclass-core/branding/handler |
| Routing | AIResourceHandler | kiteclass-core/branding/handler |
| Routing | FallbackHandler | kiteclass-core/branding/handler |
| Queue | AIQueueDispatcher | kitehub-branding/queue |
| Queue | ai.request.{enterprise,pro,free} | RabbitMQ (KiteHub) |
| Quality | InstanceQualityReviewer | kiteclass-core/quality |
| Moderation | ContentModerationService | kiteclass-core/moderation |
| AI runtime | Ollama llama3.1 + llava (current) | kite-ollama (local) |
| AI runtime | Gemma 4 9B (planned, GAP-006) | kite-ollama (future) |
endlegend

note bottom
  v2 design supersedes the original 2026-03-24 cloud-AI pipeline.
  Per ai-branding-guidelines.md §9: AI calls go to LOCAL Ollama unless
  tenant explicitly consents. AI-generated images stored in MinIO.
  Workflow lives in kiteclass-core (per Wave 2-4 implementation),
  not kitehub-branding (which now owns only queue dispatch + worker pool).
end note

@enduml
